{"id":7583,"date":"2025-10-25T06:24:59","date_gmt":"2025-10-25T06:24:59","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=7583"},"modified":"2026-08-07T07:47:25","modified_gmt":"2026-08-07T07:47:25","slug":"seo-types","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-types\/","title":{"rendered":"All Types of SEO (Search Engine Optimization): 2026 Guide"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>SEO includes a set of complex practices and techniques to improve a website\u2019s online visibility and search engine rankings. Marketers rely on different SEO strategies to drive organic traffic to the website. These tactics include keyword research, content optimization, off-page SEO, social media marketing, etc.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are various kinds of SEO methods used to optimize multiple factors to align their marketing strategies with search engine algorithms and user intent. More than distinct processes, these SEO subsets are a way to break down the complex process of SEO and make it easier to manage.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Although on-page and off-page are the two most popular types of SEO, there are other SEO methods as well that professionals use to drive better results.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This blog will help you explore different SEO types that marketers rely on to build effective campaigns.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What Is SEO?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Search Engine Optimization (SEO)<\/a> is a continuous process to boost a website\u2019s online visibility and drive organic traffic. For this, it aims at improving a website\u2019s search engine rankings for relevant keywords. SEO includes various strategies and techniques that work together to enhance user experience, optimize a website\u2019s content and structure, and make it more discoverable.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are different types of SEO, each comprising distinct elements. Gaining a clear understanding of these SEO types can help you tailor these strategies for better and more effective results.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-keywords\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">What Are Keywords in SEO? Benefits, Use, Types<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Types of Search Engine Optimization (List)<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO includes multiple approaches and strategies, and each of them intends to optimize the website for higher search engine result rankings. Below, we have listed 14 types of SEO in digital marketing:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/on-page-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">On-page SEO<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/off-page-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Off-page SEO<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Technical SEO<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/local-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Local SEO<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>E-commerce SEO&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/mobile-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Mobile SEO<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>International SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Image SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Voice SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Video SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Negative SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>White-hat SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Black-hat SEO<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gray-hat SEO<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Profession